cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "tsfm: a time-series transformer, written from scratch"
abstract: >-
  A decoder-only time-series transformer written in plain PyTorch, pretrained
  from scratch on a pinned corpus, and scored zero-shot on GIFT-Eval under a
  pre-registered protocol. Includes a content audit of the public pretraining
  corpus for overlap with the benchmark.
authors:
  - family-names: Morsi
    given-names: Sherif
repository-code: https://github.com/shmorsi/tsfm-from-scratch
url: https://github.com/shmorsi/tsfm-from-scratch
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - time series
  - forecasting
  - transformer
  - GIFT-Eval
